#: dist/release-check/gallery-for-immich/gallery-for-immich.php:433
#: gallery-for-immich.php:433
msgid ""
"Your API key and photo data will be transmitted without encryption. This is "
"not recommended unless you are on a private local network."
msgstr ""
"Ihr API-Schlüssel und Ihre Fotodaten werden ohne Verschlüsselung übertragen. "
"Dies wird nicht empfohlen, es sei denn, Sie befinden sich in einem privaten "
"lokalen Netzwerk."

#: dist/release-check/gallery-for-immich/gallery-for-immich.php:435
#: gallery-for-immich.php:435
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Abbrechen"

#: dist/release-check/gallery-for-immich/gallery-for-immich.php:436
#: gallery-for-immich.php:436
msgid "Continue with HTTP"
msgstr "Mit HTTP fortfahren"

#: dist/release-check/gallery-for-immich/gallery-for-immich.php:506
#: gallery-for-immich.php:506
msgid "Shared links (default)"
msgstr "Geteilte Links (Standard)"

#: dist/release-check/gallery-for-immich/gallery-for-immich.php:507
#: gallery-for-immich.php:507
msgid "Stream through WordPress"
msgstr "Über WordPress streamen"

#: dist/release-check/gallery-for-immich/gallery-for-immich.php:508
#: gallery-for-immich.php:508
msgid "Ignore videos"
msgstr "Videos ignorieren"

#: dist/release-check/gallery-for-immich/gallery-for-immich.php:511
#: gallery-for-immich.php:511
msgid "How it works:"
msgstr "So funktioniert es:"

#: dist/release-check/gallery-for-immich/gallery-for-immich.php:512
#: gallery-for-immich.php:512
msgid ""
"Stream through WordPress: Videos are streamed through this WordPress site, "
"so they also play for albums that are only shared with the API key's user. "
"Uses the bandwidth of your WordPress server, and needs allow_url_fopen in "
"PHP; if videos do not play, choose Shared links."
msgstr ""
"Über WordPress streamen: Videos werden über diese WordPress-Website "
"gestreamt und lassen sich daher auch in Alben abspielen, die mit dem "
"Benutzer des API-Schlüssels nur geteilt sind. Nutzt die Bandbreite Ihres "
"WordPress-Servers und benötigt allow_url_fopen in PHP; werden Videos nicht "
"abgespielt, wählen Sie Geteilte Links."

#: dist/release-check/gallery-for-immich/gallery-for-immich.php:513
#: gallery-for-immich.php:513
msgid ""
"Shared links: Creates temporary shared links on Immich (bypasses WordPress "
"server). The temporary links expire after a short period and will be removed "
"from Immich."
msgstr ""
"Freigegebene Links: erstellt temporäre freigegebene Links auf Immich (umgeht "
"die WordPress-Server). Die temporären Links verfallen nach kurzer Zeit und "
"werden aus Immich entfernt."

#: dist/release-check/gallery-for-immich/gallery-for-immich.php:514
#: gallery-for-immich.php:514
msgid "Ignore videos: Videos will not be displayed in galleries."
msgstr "Videos ignorieren: Videos werden nicht in Galerien angezeigt."

#: dist/release-check/gallery-for-immich/gallery-for-immich.php:515
#: gallery-for-immich.php:515
msgid ""
"On password-protected and private pages, videos are always streamed through "
"WordPress, because a shared link cannot be protected."
msgstr ""
"Auf passwortgeschützten und privaten Seiten werden Videos immer über "
"WordPress gestreamt, weil sich ein geteilter Link nicht schützen lässt."

#: dist/release-check/gallery-for-immich/gallery-for-immich.php:525
#: gallery-for-immich.php:525
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Aus"

#: dist/release-check/gallery-for-immich/gallery-for-immich.php:526
#: gallery-for-immich.php:526
msgid "5 minutes"
msgstr "5 Minuten"

#: dist/release-check/gallery-for-immich/gallery-for-immich.php:527
#: gallery-for-immich.php:527
msgid "15 minutes (default)"
msgstr "15 Minuten (Standard)"

#: dist/release-check/gallery-for-immich/gallery-for-immich.php:528
#: gallery-for-immich.php:528
msgid "1 hour"
msgstr "1 Stunde"

#: dist/release-check/gallery-for-immich/gallery-for-immich.php:529
#: gallery-for-immich.php:529
msgid "6 hours"
msgstr "6 Stunden"

#: dist/release-check/gallery-for-immich/gallery-for-immich.php:530
#: gallery-for-immich.php:530
msgid "1 day"
msgstr "1 Tag"

#: dist/release-check/gallery-for-immich/gallery-for-immich.php:543
#: gallery-for-immich.php:543
msgid ""
"How long album lists, album contents and photo details from Immich are kept "
"before they are fetched again. A change in Immich shows up on the site after "
"this time, or right away when you clear the cache below."
msgstr ""
"Wie lange Albenlisten, Albuminhalte und Fotodetails aus Immich aufbewahrt "
"werden, bevor sie erneut abgerufen werden. Eine Änderung in Immich erscheint "
"nach dieser Zeit auf der Website, oder sofort, wenn Sie unten den Cache "
"leeren."

#: dist/release-check/gallery-for-immich/gallery-for-immich.php:551
#: dist/release-check/gallery-for-immich/gallery-for-immich.php:1382
#: gallery-for-immich.php:551 gallery-for-immich.php:1382
msgid "You do not have sufficient permissions to access this page."
msgstr ""
"Sie haben nicht die erforderlichen Berechtigungen, um auf diese Seite "
"zuzugreifen."

#: dist/release-check/gallery-for-immich/gallery-for-immich.php:560
#: gallery-for-immich.php:560
msgid "Cache cleared. Galleries now show the current state of Immich."
msgstr ""
"Cache geleert. Die Galerien zeigen jetzt den aktuellen Stand von Immich."

#: dist/release-check/gallery-for-immich/gallery-for-immich.php:571
#: dist/release-check/gallery-for-immich/gallery-for-immich.php:573
#: dist/release-check/gallery-for-immich/gallery-for-immich.php:592
